  <div class="section">
    <h2>B2B Sales and Sales Management</h2>
    <p>Most B2B sales problems aren't about lack of activity. They're about lack of direction, prioritisation and consistency. I work with pipeline analysis, sales process design, deal progression, stakeholder management and forecast discipline.</p>
