    <h2>Communication that Builds Trust</h2>
    <p>Sales isn't just decided by what you say. It's decided by how the customer understands, feels and dares to move forward. This covers positioning, handling hesitation, creating clarity when customers are uncertain, and adapting messages to different decision-makers.</p>
    <a href="/en/training-workshops/">Read about training and workshops &rarr;</a>
