  <div class="section">
    <h2>AI in the Sales Process</h2>
    <p>Most companies implement AI backwards, they start with the tool and hope the business logic shows up. I work from three questions: Where does AI actually create value in your process? How do you integrate AI support without losing the human ability to build trust? How do you measure whether it's working?</p>
